{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8b1a7584a1a37b70","type":"tool_result","content":"# Config CRD instance for the deep Sentry bug analyzer (sentry-deep-analyzer\n# task type, same binary as the triage agent). The triage execution phase\n# reassigns a task to this assignee on a `verdict: real bug`, and the executor\n# routes it here — one deep run per flagged alert, never batch.\n# Apply with: kubectlnukedev -n dev apply -f k8s/sentry-deep-analyzer-config.yaml\n\napiVersion: agent.benjamin-borbe.de/v1\nkind: Config\nmetadata:\n  name: sentry-deep-analyzer\n  namespace: dev\nspec:\n  assignee: sentry-deep-analyzer\n  image: docker.prod.nuke.benjamin-borbe.de:443/agent-sentry-issue-analyzer:dev\n  heartbeat: 5m\n  maxConcurrentJobs: 1\n  priorityClassName: agent-sentry-issue-analyzer\n\n  taskTypes:\n    - sentry-deep-analyzer\n    - healthcheck\n\n  trigger:\n    phases:\n      - planning\n      - execution\n    statuses:\n      - in_progress\n\n  resources:\n    limits:\n      cpu: 500m\n      memory: 512Mi\n    requests:\n      cpu: 100m\n      memory: 128Mi\n\n  env:\n    ALLOWED_TOOLS: \"Bash(scripts/sentry-read.sh:*),Bash(scripts/repo-clone.sh:*),Read,Edit,Grep\"\n    ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL: \"http://claude-code-router-dev:8788\"\n    ANTHROPIC_MODEL: \"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed\"\n    CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR: \"/home/claude/.claude\"\n    LOGLEVEL: \"2\"\n    # GitHub App auth for read-only cloning of private repos (repo-clone.sh).\n    # Per the fleet standard (github-releaser pattern), the deep analyzer gets\n    # its OWN dedicated GitHub App family (dev + prod) — NOT the shared reviewer\n    # App. PEM_KEY comes from the mounted secret (agent-sentry-issue-analyzer)\n    # and is minted to an IAT at startup. APP_ID/INSTALLATION_ID are public\n    # values (safe in manifests); the PEM is secret, in teamvault → secret.\n    # Dev App: \"Ben's Sentry Deep Analyzer Dev\" (installed on bborbe/go-skeleton).\n    APP_ID: \"4710983\"\n    INSTALLATION_ID: \"156399284\"\n\n  secretName: agent-sentry-issue-analyzer\n\n  volumeClaim: agent-sentry-issue-analyzer\n  volumeMountPath: /home/claude/.claude\n---PROD---\n# Config CRD instance for the deep Sentry bug analyzer (sentry-deep-analyzer\n# task type, same binary as the triage agent). The triage execution phase\n# reassigns a task to this assignee on a `verdict: real bug`, and the executor\n# routes it here — one deep run per flagged alert, never batch.\n# Apply with: kubectlnukeprod -n prod apply -f k8s/sentry-deep-analyzer-config.yaml\n\napiVersion: agent.benjamin-borbe.de/v1\nkind: Config\nmetadata:\n  name: sentry-deep-analyzer\n  namespace: prod\nspec:\n  assignee: sentry-deep-analyzer\n  image: docker.prod.nuke.benjamin-borbe.de:443/agent-sentry-issue-analyzer:prod\n  heartbeat: 5m\n  maxConcurrentJobs: 1\n  priorityClassName: agent-sentry-issue-analyzer\n\n  taskTypes:\n    - sentry-deep-analyzer\n    - healthcheck\n\n  trigger:\n    phases:\n      - planning\n      - execution\n    statuses:\n      - in_progress\n\n  resources:\n    limits:\n      cpu: 500m\n      memory: 512Mi\n    requests:\n      cpu: 100m\n      memory: 128Mi\n\n  env:\n    ALLOWED_TOOLS: \"Bash(scripts/sentry-read.sh:*),Bash(scripts/repo-clone.sh:*),Read,Edit,Grep\"\n    ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL: \"http://claude-code-router-prod:8788\"\n    ANTHROPIC_MODEL: \"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed\"\n    CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR: \"/home/claude/.claude\"\n    LOGLEVEL: \"2\"\n    # GitHub App auth for read-only cloning of private repos (repo-clone.sh).\n    # Per the fleet standard (github-releaser pattern), the deep analyzer gets\n    # its OWN dedicated GitHub App family (dev + prod) — NOT the shared reviewer\n    # App. PEM_KEY comes from the mounted secret (agent-sentry-issue-analyzer)\n    # and is minted to an IAT at startup. APP_ID/INSTALLATION_ID are public\n    # values (safe in manifests); the PEM is secret, in teamvault → secret.\n    # Prod App: \"Ben's Sentry Deep Analyzer\" (installed on bborbe/*).\n    APP_ID: \"4710998\"\n    INSTALLATION_ID: \"156399409\"\n\n  secretName: agent-sentry-issue-analyzer\n\n  volumeClaim: agent-sentry-issue-analyzer\n  volumeMountPath: /home/claude/.claude","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05623c25-dd2c-4170-bc7d-4816c834e8f3","uuid":"70b4befa-0d97-4db9-9cbb-faf71e7e8636","timestamp":"2026-09-03T19:56:27.127Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"# Config CRD instance for the deep Sentry bug analyzer (sentry-deep-analyzer\n# task type, same binary as the triage agent). The triage execution phase\n# reassigns a task to this assignee on a `verdict: real bug`, and the executor\n# routes it here — one deep run per flagged alert, never batch.\n# Apply with: kubectlnukedev -n dev apply -f k8s/sentry-deep-analyzer-config.yaml\n\napiVersion: agent.benjamin-borbe.de/v1\nkind: Config\nmetadata:\n  name: sentry-deep-analyzer\n  namespace: dev\nspec:\n  assignee: sentry-deep-analyzer\n  image: docker.prod.nuke.benjamin-borbe.de:443/agent-sentry-issue-analyzer:dev\n  heartbeat: 5m\n  maxConcurrentJobs: 1\n  priorityClassName: agent-sentry-issue-analyzer\n\n  taskTypes:\n    - sentry-deep-analyzer\n    - healthcheck\n\n  trigger:\n    phases:\n      - planning\n      - execution\n    statuses:\n      - in_progress\n\n  resources:\n    limits:\n      cpu: 500m\n      memory: 512Mi\n    requests:\n      cpu: 100m\n      memory: 128Mi\n\n  env:\n    ALLOWED_TOOLS: \"Bash(scripts/sentry-read.sh:*),Bash(scripts/repo-clone.sh:*),Read,Edit,Grep\"\n    ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL: \"http://claude-code-router-dev:8788\"\n    ANTHROPIC_MODEL: \"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed\"\n    CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR: \"/home/claude/.claude\"\n    LOGLEVEL: \"2\"\n    # GitHub App auth for read-only cloning of private repos (repo-clone.sh).\n    # Per the fleet standard (github-releaser pattern), the deep analyzer gets\n    # its OWN dedicated GitHub App family (dev + prod) — NOT the shared reviewer\n    # App. PEM_KEY comes from the mounted secret 